  "summary": "PR #15021 adds a new Bazel-based workflow for building and packaging `rusty_v8`, including musl targets for x86_64/aarch64, while removing `third_party/v8` from the default CI test path so V8 work is handled by dedicated canary/release flows.",
  "title": "Add a dedicated Bazel pipeline for building and releasing rusty_v8 artifacts",
  "why_it_matters": "This gives the project a reliable way to produce and publish prebuilt V8 artifacts for additional toolchains (notably musl), improving build reproducibility for dependents and reducing pressure on normal CI by isolating heavy V8 builds into explicit workflows."
